            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/characteristic+zero"} characteristic zero
            and in positive degrees the model structure is due to
          %ul
            %li#Quillen69
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dan+Quillen"}> Dan Quillen
              , section II.5 and appendix B of
              = succeed "," do
